<title>UK: Moldova sets $75 mln five-year bond, 340 bp over.</title>
<headline>Moldova sets $75 mln five-year bond, 340 bp over.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MOLDOVA</p>
<p> AMT	  $75 MLN   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    13.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    13.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+340 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  B	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/GB/MJ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.50 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 31.MAY.02</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
